+# (AXIS_RELATIVE_Y, which keeps counting while the cursor is pinned to the edge) within 500 ms of
+# its first downward move there. Games can keep the cursor at the bottom without the taskbar
+# popping up. Touch swipes from the edge take detectSwipe and are unchanged.
